The generated prompt's "Output" path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/**` does
NOT match this repository. The real, build-compiled convention (project.yml compiles
`apps/apple/Sources/**`, and every sibling P7 page — Powershare, VampireDrain,
BatteryHealth, SleepEfficiency — lives under it) is:

    apps/apple/Sources/Features/Charging/**

The page was implemented there so it actually compiles into the iOS + macOS app targets
(verified: all 8 SmartCharge*.swift appear as SwiftCompile units in the macOS build).
`apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/` is NOT a compiled source root in project.yml;
placing the file there would produce dead, uncompiled code. Faithful interpretation of
the artifact's intent ("the Charging feature directory"), not scope narrowing. The
co-located XCTest lives under `apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Features/Charging/` per project.yml.

